ComfyUI-UniVidX vendors UniVidX in full at a pinned commit under
vendor/univid/, and reuses it unmodified: the denoising loop, Cross-Modal
Self-Attention, per-modality LoRA routing, the schedulers, the VAE and text
encoder, and every decode branch are upstream's own code. This pack replaces
only model loading, so that weights resolve through ComfyUI's model
directories instead of paths relative to the process working directory.

Upstream's own licence text is preserved verbatim at vendor/univid/LICENSE.
Upstream ships no NOTICE file, so there is none to reproduce. The pinned
commit, the contents of the snapshot, and the procedure for refreshing it are
recorded in vendor/univid/VENDOR.md.

The published UniVidX model weights (univid_intrinsic.safetensors and
univid_alpha.safetensors) are distributed by their authors under the Apache
License, Version 2.0, and are not redistributed here.

UniVidX builds on Wan2.1-T2V-14B (Wan-AI) and DiffSynth-Studio (ModelScope).
Those components are obtained by the user and are not redistributed here;
their own licences apply.

A separate third-party ComfyUI wrapper for UniVidX exists under the GNU
General Public License v3.0. No code from it appears in this pack. Where this
pack solves a problem that project also solved, the implementation was derived
from upstream's own source and from documented file formats.

